      "name": "pay",
      "docs": [
        "Pay a merchant on the agent's behalf, if and only if the payment fits the",
        "mandate.",
        "",
        "This is the heart of the program. Every check below runs on-chain, so a",
        "compromised agent, server or signing key cannot skip them."
      ],
